    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(3rd Level)</em></p><p><strong>Noise:</strong> +1</p><p>Once per scene, when an <strong>Out of Compliance</strong> target violates a binding contract or established precedent, you may:</p><ul><li><p>Force a reroll (taking the worse result), <strong>or</strong></p></li><li><p>Cause the target to lose its action.</p></li></ul><p>This represents procedural enforcement—not anger.</p><h3>Cost</h3><p>Free (1/scene).</p><h3>Escalation</h3><p>If paired with a Surge spend, the action loss cannot be mitigated by Boss immunity (GM adjudicated) (GM adjudicated).</p><h3>Pushback</h3><p>Repeated public enforcement increases visibility.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
